This file exists so JobDocs Kiosk's installer has something to copy into
app\shared\ under `#ifdef KIOSK` (see build_scripts/JobDocs.iss's [Files]
section). shared.utils.is_kiosk_install() checks for it on disk to tell a
Kiosk install apart from a regular one — a build-time signal baked into the
installer payload itself, not something written by a post-install script
(compare build_scripts/JobDocs.iss's CurStepChanged, which is why the old
readonly.marker approach could be deleted post-install and silently break
config-dir isolation; see CodeRabbit, PR #315). Do not delete this file from
the repo, and a running Kiosk install should never need to touch its copy.
